# The fork patch archives are consumed verbatim: setup.bat applies them with `git apply`
# (step 3) and framework_pin_check.py rebuilds the fork tree from them. A CRLF checkout
# makes hunks fail to match a LF tree, which would show up as "neither applied nor
# appliable" instead of the drift it is meant to be, so the archives stay LF everywhere.
*.patch text eol=lf
